{"data": {"acceptance": ["PermissionError and other OSError instances raised by project_workspace_service.open_project do not escape handle_open_project_requested.", "The failure displays QMessageBox.warning with the localized dialog.project_error_title and str(error), then returns without activating a project.", "Existing ValueError handling is preserved, with FileNotFoundError covered through the OSError hierarchy.", "Filesystem I/O failures still propagate from the workspace service without resetting, deleting, or self-healing project artifacts.", "A focused test monkeypatches open_project to raise PermissionError and verifies the warning path completes without a crash.", "Existing project-open recovery and main-window project-flow tests remain green.", "The complete pytest and Ruff repository gates pass."], "assumptions": [], "created_at": "2026-07-29T16:27:34+00:00", "decision": "proceed", "open_questions": [], "planned_paths": ["04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/ui/controllers/home_ui_controller.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_home_ui_controller.py", ".agentic/requirements/functional/REQ-FUNC-810d9787-dc4d-4ed6-8b7e-e746fefdf658.toml", ".agentic/knowledge/components/Project_Lifecycle.md"], "reason": "Issue #30 supplies an exact exception-boundary fix and checkable acceptance criteria; the project-lifecycle component is baseline-usable and intake audits are clean.", "recommended_responses": [], "risk": "low", "scope": ["In scope: Home controller exception handling, one focused controller regression test, the affected durable project-open requirement, and Project Lifecycle documentation. Out of scope: changes to project_workspace_service recovery decisions, reset/deletion behavior, repair flows, localization catalogs, and unrelated controller error handling."], "source": "Gitea issue #30: http://192.168.1.15:3001/dpasare/2026_AudioMancer/issues/30", "understanding": "When Open Project fails with PermissionError or another OSError, the Home controller must contain the exception at the Qt slot boundary and present the existing localized project-error warning with the original error text. The service must continue propagating filesystem failures without destructive reset or self-healing."}, "event": "alignment.recorded", "time": "2026-07-29T16:27:34+00:00"}
